{"id":"n67431-1-7","stage":4,"title":"엉엉 · 呜呜","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67431-1-7-1","ko":"아기가 어제부터 왜 이렇게 엉엉 우는지 모르겠어요.","zh":"我不知道宝宝从昨天开始为什么一直哭个不停。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아기가","meaning":"小孩，婴儿","explanation":"아기：小孩，婴儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아기","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20235","senseId":"1","lemma":"아기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아기가","audio":"/audio/26e60641381a50692ff7.mp3"}},{"text":"어제부터","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제부터","audio":"/audio/fa5986b33a7131d51bc9.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"엉엉","meaning":"呜呜","explanation":"엉엉：呜呜。","readings":[{"term":"엉엉","audio":"/audio/382de3884ac9474d65bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67431","senseId":"1","lemma":"엉엉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엉엉","audio":"/audio/382de3884ac9474d65bf.mp3"}},{"text":"우는지","meaning":"哭，哭泣","explanation":"울다：哭，哭泣；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"울다","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69523","senseId":"1","lemma":"울다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우는지","audio":"/audio/6d86e3d3e341147e5180.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어요","audio":"/audio/262161281aabff06df61.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d5fa7c0faafdc9fc","term":"아기","zh":"小孩，婴儿","audio":"/audio/d5fa7c0faafdc9fccb16.mp3","entryId":"20235","definition":"吃着奶的非常幼小的孩子。","pronunciation":["아기"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"382de3884ac9474d","term":"엉엉","zh":"呜呜","audio":"/audio/382de3884ac9474d65bf.mp3","entryId":"67431","definition":"放声大哭的声音；或指其模样。","pronunciation":["엉엉"]},{"id":"7136d2464083681e","term":"울다","zh":"哭，哭泣","audio":"/audio/7136d2464083681e4841.mp3","entryId":"69523","definition":"因为伤心、疼痛或太高兴而忍不住流眼泪；或指一边那样流眼泪一边发出声音。","pronunciation":["울ː다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/829f383b2614c77f9df5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67431-1-7-2","ko":"어디 아픈 거 아니에요? 병원에 가 봐요.","zh":"是不是哪里不舒服啊？去医院看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"아픈","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아픈","audio":"/audio/9277b72aca0bb2178064.mp3"}},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}},{"text":"아니에요?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}},{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"가","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가","audio":"/audio/64ee5293d31bc58b72d7.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/13c727df4f24bb35fb24.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.065,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67431","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":146,"sequenceScore":2.8917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是不是哪里不舒服啊？去医院看看吧。","我不知道宝宝从昨天开始为什么一直哭个不停。","你是什么时候确定自己的人生方向的？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不知道宝宝从昨天开始为什么一直哭个不停。","你是什么时候确定自己的人生方向的？","是不是哪里不舒服啊？去医院看看吧。"],"answer":2}]}
